Closed-form statistics reach about 0.69 (LDA) and 0.70 (regularized QDA) in 5-fold, kNN-1 0.71. Next I check whether a simple per-feature squashing (clip or asinh, which silu units can approximate) helps the Gaussian models, since several size features are heavy-tailed.
